  "notes": [
    "20 original mesh definitions include 16 species-specific/plant-category entries and four general archetypes; do not misrepresent all 20 as distinct botanical species.",
    "121 legacy *_plants.json placement products remain referenced by exact path and Git blob SHA; their large payloads are not copied by this metadata commit.",
    "Original placement sources rely on ARSO 2014 LiDAR: spatial occupancy and dimensions are evidence for 2014, not exact 1990s individual tree or species observations.",
    "Original placement species are inferred by ecological region, not measured directly by LiDAR.",
    "Preserve same place/street and stable species IDs; later reviewed canonical transforms may reject contemporary removals or changes.",
    "Meshes may need independent rights/provenance review, Unreal 5.8.3 reimport, material reconstruction and owner visual approval.",
    "Avoid experimental Nanite foliage dependency; ordinary Unreal foliage/HISM + measured LOD/HLOD is acceptable baseline."
  ],
